    <preface>
      <p>Social Services and Other Legislation Amendment (Seniors Supplement Cessation) Act 2015</p>
      <p>No. 91, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to social security and veterans’ entitlements, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	2</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Energy supplement replacing seniors supplement	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Main amendments	3</p>
      <p>Social Security Act 1991	3</p>
      <p>Social Security (Administration) Act 1999	5</p>
      <p>Veterans’ Entitlements Act 1986	7</p>
