                <heading>Paragraph 1061R(d)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Omit “seniors supplement under this Act or the Veterans’ Entitlements Act”, substitute “energy supplement under <ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>.25B of this Act or <ref href="#part-VIIA">Part VIIA</ref>D of the Veterans’ Entitlements Act”.</p>
                </content>
              </hcontainer>
