                  <num>1</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>(1)	Paragraph 916D(3)(c) of the <i>Social Security Act 1991 </i>applies on and after the commencement of this item as if a reference in that paragraph to energy supplement included a reference to seniors supplement.</p>
