              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-3__item-20">
                <num>44</num>
                <heading>Subsections 118PB(1) and (1A)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Repeal the subsections, substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-3__item-20__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-3__item-20__qstr-1__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>If subsection (2) applies to the person on a day, the person’s daily rate of energy supplement, for that day, is 1/364 of the amount worked out using the following table:</p>
                    </content>
                    <table>
                      <tr>
                        <td>Energy supplement</td>
                        <td>Energy supplement</td>
                        <td>Energy supplement</td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td>Item</td>
                        <td>Person’s family situation</td>
                        <td>Amount of energy supplement</td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td>1</td>
                        <td>Not a member of a couple</td>
                        <td>$366.60</td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td>2</td>
                        <td>Partnered</td>
                        <td>$275.60</td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td>3</td>
                        <td>Member of an illness separated couple</td>
                        <td>$366.60</td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td>4</td>
                        <td>Member of a respite care couple</td>
                        <td>$366.60</td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                    <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                      <content>
                        <p>Note:	For <b><i>member of a couple</i></b>, <b><i>partnered</i></b>, <b><i>illness separated couple</i></b> and <b><i>respite care couple</i></b> see subsections 5E(1) and (5) and 5R(5) and (6) respectively.</p>
                      </content>
                    </authorialNote>
                  </subsection>
                </quotedStructure>
              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-3__item-21">
                <num>45</num>
